flowchart TD
    Header[Read mode and n] --> Check{Valid header and combination?}
    Check -->|No| Error[Error to stderr and exit 1]
    Check -->|Yes| Initial[Read exactly n initial readings]
    Initial --> Backend[Construct selected backend]
    Backend --> Read{Read next command}
    Read -->|EOF| Done[Exit 0]
    Read -->|Blank line| Read
    Read -->|Command| Validate{Valid syntax, mode and indices?}
    Validate -->|No| Error
    Validate -->|Yes| Dispatch[Call matching interface method]
    Dispatch --> Kind{Query or update?}
    Kind -->|Update| Read
    Kind -->|Query| Print[Print one integer and newline]
    Print --> Read
